{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":74058,"duration_api_ms":73434,"num_turns":28,"result":"I rewrote the existing `CLAUDE.md` in place. I checked the claims against the Makefiles, workflows and `.gitmodules`, but didn't build anything.\n\n- **Corrected:** the old file said every tutorial has a Makefile. Lessons 1–10 and a few others have none and build with `ecc`/`ecli`. 26 lessons have a Makefile, which the file now explains.\n- **Submodules:** `src/third_party/libbpf` is a symlink into the `bpftool` submodule, so builds fail until you run `git submodule update --init --recursive`.\n- **Build system:** the Makefiles are near-copies of the `src/11-bootstrap/Makefile` template, so the file describes how that build works and notes that a fix often applies to the sibling Makefiles. `src/34-syscall` is the one that doesn't use `third_party/libbpf`.\n- **CI:** both workflows list lessons by hand, so a new lesson has to be added to the matching one.\n- **Tutorial writing:** it points to the README guidelines and `generate_toc.py`, and notes that every lesson needs both English and Chinese READMEs.\n- **Tests:** there are no unit tests or linters, so testing an example means building it and running it briefly.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"cdabf226-8673-4361-84d2-7e4b35df6d46","total_cost_usd":0.39970349999999993,"usage":{"input_tokens":36,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22584,"cache_read_input_tokens":614785,"output_tokens":8698,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":22584},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":414,"cache_read_input_tokens":46041,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2341,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2341,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":36,"o